**Google Search Console** (Google Webmaster tool) helps you monitor your site’s presence in search results by understanding how Google views your store, **Google Analytics** helps you track and evaluate the productivity of your website activities.

Google Analytics 4 is a new kind of [property](https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/9355666) designed for the future of measurement:&#x20;

* Collects both website and app data to better understand the customer journey
* Uses event-based data instead of session-based
* Includes privacy controls such as cookieless measurement, and behavioral and conversion modeling
* Predictive capabilities offer guidance without complex models
* Direct integrations to media platforms help drive actions on your website or app

With the SearchPie guideline, you can easily integrate GA4 into your store with some simple steps below:&#x20;

**Step 1: Create your Google Analytics 4 property.**&#x20;

{% embed url="<https://youtu.be/7YtvdhLOoUE>" %}

After you have your property and create a web data stream, you should make a note of the **Tag ID** because you'll use it in Step 2.

**Step 2: Add Google Analytics 4**

#### Step 3: How can I help these Google Search Console issues?&#x20;

Google Search Console issues can be complex, especially those related to **indexing** and **structured data** requirements from Google.

Because of this complexity, resolving these issues often requires the involvement of a **technical SEO expert or developer** to properly analyze and fix them. Incorrect fixes may lead to further indexing or visibility problems.

Therefore, we highly recommend you signing up our **Google Search Console service.**&#x20;

Google Search Console service is a **one-time payment service, with 6-month warranty**. Our technical team can help you fix all the issues in Indexing, Shopping & Enhancement sections. Besides, during 6-month warranty, whenever you have new Google Search Console issues, our team can run the auto-tool to help you detect and fix the issue as soon as possible.&#x20;

<figure><img src="/files/hTIm6LakEu3R4Q0nLhWs" alt=""><figcaption></figcaption></figure>

If you need our support to clarify more about this service, please feel free to drop us a line via Livechat! 🌷


